{
 "encounter_id": "00853",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Morning. Er, the memory clinic. My daughter says I should come. I'm fine, though I do forget a few things. Not much."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you for coming back. I've got your notes. How have things been since your last visit?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, the same. Mostly. Names, sometimes. And where I've put things. I found my glasses in the fridge."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When did you first notice the forgetfulness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Er, two years ago? Or three. I can't be sure. The wife would know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does anything frighten you, getting lost, leaving the gas on? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I get a bit confused about the day. But I'm all right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any change in mood, or sleep? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. I sleep like a log. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's go through the tablets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Donepezil, 10 mg, once a day, in the morning. Amlodipine, 5 mg. And a statin, atorvastatin, 20 mg at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any side effects from the donepezil? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Vivid dreams. And a bit of an upset stomach at first. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, high cholesterol, and I had a mini-stroke, two years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does dementia run in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had it, in her eighties."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 66, blood pressure 138 over 80, temperature 36.5, oxygen 98 percent, weight 79 kilos.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine, and your weight is steady. Now I'd like to do the memory test again, as we did last time. I'll ask you some questions. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's today's date? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The, er, fourteenth? No, the, I'd have to check.",
   "pause": 40.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Can you remember the three words I asked you to remember? Apple, table, penny. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Apple, table, and, um, that other one.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, you've scored 22 out of 30, which is the same as six months ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's stable, which is encouraging. It shows some difficulty with memory and orientation, but it hasn't got worse, and the donepezil may be helping. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So I'm not getting worse? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not on this test. I'd like you to continue all your tablets as they are."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep your mind active, puzzles, conversation, walking, and keep the routine simple. Leave notes on the fridge."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The wife does that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. I'd like to see you again in six months, and sooner if things change."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six months. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
